# Wordmap YAML routing

Read `AGENTS.md` first, then its applicable task documents in full.
Use `docs/ai-map.md` for ID-based retrieval; do not load all YAML by default.

- Canonical sources: `terms-all.yaml`, `relations.yaml`, `propositions.yaml`, `curriculum.yaml` in `src/data/`.
- Do not edit generated `terms.json` or legacy `src/data/terms/*.yaml`.
- Data changes: read `docs/agent-data-guide.md`, `docs/data-quality.md`, `docs/learning-authoring.md`.
- Terms/relations: `docs/data-schema.md`; propositions: `docs/propositions-schema.md` and `docs/agent-propositions-guide.md`.
- Example: `node scripts/ai-context.js search "금리"`, then `get interest-rate` and `context interest-rate`.
- Search synonyms and both endpoint orders before adding; read complete matching records.
- Update relevant learning references and missing graph bridges in the same authorized task.
- Data validation: `node build-data.js`, `npm run validate-data`, `node scripts/audit-learning.js`, `npm run build`.
- Economic meaning, direction and equivalence require manual review even if checks pass.
- Commit and push only when the user explicitly requests each action.
